                "NF3 cell NF-3 on Trifluor-Yett TY-4 already prints NDIR HF at 8.6 vol percent, 2.6 "
                "over the 6.0 license, while rectifier voltage is still a lawful 4.2 V of a 5.5 V "
                "envelope. HF-first cuts cell current 18.0 kA to 11.0; a bus-first cruise would keep "
                "18.0 kA. Anode-cover brick stays mute on both publishers until AE later in the raster.",